# Two Lesson cards are in the graveyard (Abandon Attachments, which is itself a Lesson, and the Boomerang Basics it
# discarded) while Accumulate Wisdom is on the stack: the graveyard is read as it resolves and the spell is still on the
# stack, so it is not the third Lesson (CR 608.2c) and only ONE of the top three goes to the hand.
# Abandon is paid with Mox Sapphire ({U/R}) and Mox Jet ({1}); Accumulate Wisdom with Island ({U}) and Mox Ruby ({1}).
# Abandon draws Plains, Plains; Accumulate Wisdom then looks at Brainstorm, Ancestral Recall, Counterspell.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Abandon Attachments
Boomerang Basics
Accumulate Wisdom
Plains
Plains
Brainstorm
Ancestral Recall
Counterspell
Swamp x8

